00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:18.790
Ok goodnight.

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:19.920
Goodnight.

00:21:21.550 --> 00:21:22.880
I'll protect you.

00:21:23.760 --> 00:21:26.260
I'll protect you, Sana-chan.

00:21:27.090 --> 00:21:29.010
